<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the eighth day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, fourth round:</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 6-7 (4-7) 6-3 6-4 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 4-6 6-2 6-7 (7-9) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Women's singles, fourth round:</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat 9-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) 6-4 6-4 Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat 15-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 4-6 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Men's singles, fourth round:</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) beat 8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 6-3 6-2 3-2 (retired)</p>
</text>
